    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Location:** Where do you live now, and where would the company be based after YC? Use the format City A, Country A / City B, Country B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "…"
